            <Pad Id="QH5HUSFfT7WL8E3HDtFHnx" Bounds="-50,1100,240,102" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="DeNiro can't be asked for a value at an arbitrary time. Before we started we answer with the start value, otherwise with the latest one.&#xD;&#xA;DeNiro starts where it is told to go. So it is created with Goto Position 0 and only then sent to 1.">
